          ✅ Step 5: Take Physical Base Backup

Create backup folder:

`mkdir C:\PostgreSQL\database_backup`        

          Run base backup:

`cd "C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\17\bin"`        

          `pg_basebackup -D "C:\PostgreSQL\database_backup" -U postgres -Fp -Xs -P`        

          When prompted, enter password: admin@123

